  "issue": {
    "body": "As is asking https://github.com/encode/starlette/issues/980 for customizing the default executor and set a specific number of threads.\r\n\r\nI would like to use a **ProcessPoolExecutor** and not a **ThreadPoolExecutor** since I have a CPU expensive compute operation and I don't want my main process ( starlette ) to be stuck with the GIL when this operation occur.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think about this new feature ?",
